        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8354, Arts and Crafts Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arts & Crafts Style of door hardware has long been a favorite for it's unique take on southwest decor. The Double Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt will fit doors 1-1/2 inches to 2-5/8 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Arts and Crafts Double Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 4 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, matte black, and brass, all of which look beautiful on this traditional door lock. With double cylinder deadbolts, the latch is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior as well as the interior. These types of deadbolts are usually used on doors near windows or that have glass, so that the deadbolt cannot be unlocked by using the thumbturn after breaking a window since they require a key for egress.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both exterior and the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-arts-and-crafts-deadbolt-emtek-8454\"><b>Single Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Arts and Crafts Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Arts & Crafts Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" to 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8454-finish.jpg?v=1704354519\" width=\"456\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8354 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Double Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt",
                "description": "The Arts & Crafts Style of door hardware has long been a favorite for it's unique take on southwest decor. The Double Cylinder Arts and Crafts Deadbolt will fit doors 1-1/2 inches to 2-5/8 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Arts and Crafts Double Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 4 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, matte black, and brass, all of which look beautiful on this traditional door lock. With double cylinder deadbolts, the latch is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior as well as the interior. These types of deadbolts are usually used on doors near windows or that have glass, so that the deadbolt cannot be unlocked by using the thumbturn after breaking a window since they require a key for egress.",
